# Ketra and Varka soldiers (KetraOrcSupport, VarkaSilenosSupport) and a Ketra ally of level 1: the
# ally's hit on a Varka recruit is left alone, the one on a Ketra footman makes it petrify the ally
# (Raid Curse, 4515) and forget the hit, so its kill rewards no one. The cast itself is in
# alliance_support_see_spell.scenario and alliance_support_clan_attacked.scenario: a traced NPC
# line takes no skill, which a scenario monster needs to cast. Killing the recruit keeps the
# alliance; killing the footman breaks it, the level 1 badge going with no lower one given.
# Expectations are derived from the reference source (onAttacked, onMyDying, testKetraDemote) and
# replay the reference trace.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/alliance_support_petrify.golden
character Ally 40
standing 1
hold 7211 1
script script.feature.KetraOrcSupport
script script.feature.VarkaSilenosSupport
item 7211
npc footman 21324 Monster 40 0 0
npc recruit 21350 Monster -40 0 0

hit recruit 10
hit footman 10

kill recruit
  S SystemMessage id=95 1:0 1:0
  items 7211=1
kill footman
  S SystemMessage id=302 3:7211
  items 7211=0
